# Review Rust changes — "safely"

**Stack:** Rust

## Context

- @README.md

## Required

- Never touch `unsafe` blocks
- When working in `src/ui/**`: WCAG 2.1 AA

## Preferred

- Prefer small diffs

## Ask First

- Adding a dependency

## Protected Files

The following files and directories must not be modified under any circumstances. If a task requires changes to these paths, STOP and report the conflict.

- `src/auth/**` — security reviewed

## Deliverable

A review comment per finding.
Each names a file and a line.
